# ユーザ環境設定's 音属性 (design 11.6, 6.5.1), for tools/ui_run.py with --wav F: 〈試聴〉 of the
# buzzer and of the clicks, and the clicks of a pointer's button, all played as the system
# plays its sounds, on the output it has chosen (the USB sound device the --wav option puts
# beside the machine), so they are in F afterwards. The window is at 180,90: the tag 音属性
# at 520,134; the buzzer's 試聴 at 414,270, the clicks' at 414,408, and the switch ボタン of
# 有無 at 515,445. Ctrl+E closes; what was set is put back (元に戻して終了 at 530,393).
open 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53
expect userenv: ready
wait 800
win ユーザ環境設定
click 520 134
wait 400
shot ue_sound
click 414 270
expect userenv: PLAY buzzer tone 0
wait 1500
click 414 408
expect userenv: PLAY press tone 0
expect userenv: PLAY release tone 0
wait 1500
# a pointer's button clicks: the desktop's own sounds, by the same way
click 515 445
wait 1500
click 600 520
wait 800
click 600 520
wait 1500
shot ue_sound_on
click 515 445
wait 500
key 08 01
wait 800
shot ue_close
absent !OACV!
